{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.kelvin_dispersion_derivation","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L42-L53","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe [discrete vortex spectrum](#prop:discrete-vortex-spectrum) states\nthat the eigenvalues of the $q$-Laplacian on a vortex filament are\n$\\lambda_k^{(q)} = [k]_q^2 \\cdot \\hbar_q / L_q^2$.  This\nsubsection derives this from first principles.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:kelvin-dispersion-derivation","label":"prop:kelvin-dispersion-derivation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/kelvin-dispersion-derivation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.impl_dispersion_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.impl_dispersion_identity","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Manuscript dispersion identity:\n`λ_k^{(q)} = [k]_q² · ℏ_q / L_q²` for every level `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.dispersion_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.dispersion_active","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Hypothesis that the dispersion relation is derived. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.dispersion_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.dispersion_derived","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Proposition: the dispersion relation is derived. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.q_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.q_int","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L32-L32","doc":"The `q`-integer `[k]_q : ℕ → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.«λ»","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.«λ»","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The discrete eigenvalue `λ_k^{(q)} : ℕ → ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.L_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.L_q","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Vortex filament length `L_q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.hbar_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.hbar_q","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Quantum Planck constant `ℏ_q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.q","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L24-L24","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/kelvin_dispersion_derivation.lean#L22-L22","doc":"The categorical object / monoidal structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.KelvinDispersionDerivationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103c